/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-14T11:13:58-08:00","id":1432229,"title":"","content":"I think the important question is why didn\u2019t you read the content guidelines to start with? Third Edition updates are pretty high on the list, as I understand it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1424-ghanjrho","name":"GhanjRho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1424_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-14T14:00:26-08:00","id":1432249,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GhanjRho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1431986-sidereal-jumpstart?p=1432229#post1432229\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Third Edition updates are pretty high on the list, as I understand it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Literally rule one.<br /> <br /> But you could give it away for us.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-14T14:22:42-08:00","id":1432251,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GhanjRho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1431986-sidereal-jumpstart?p=1432229#post1432229\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the important question is why didn\u2019t you read the content guidelines to start with? Third Edition updates are pretty high on the list, as I understand it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wrote the document for my table first, the storyteller vault second. As such, I was not familiar with the guidelines.<br /> <br /> Regarding free distribution, it is a translation of Sidereals (heavily pulling from 2e and 1e Charms for names, costs, theme, etc.) into 3e mechanics, with a hefty amount of homebrew added in to give it that 3e Charms chapter heft. So I'd feel uncomfortable if the owners of the original work weren't compensated.<br /> <br /> I thought the storyteller vault was the place for such works, but I was incorrect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-14T17:25:48-08:00","id":1432267,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tikor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1431986-sidereal-jumpstart?p=1432251#post1432251\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wrote the document for my table first, the storyteller vault second. As such, I was not familiar with the guidelines.<br /> <br /> Regarding free distribution, it is a translation of Sidereals (heavily pulling from 2e and 1e Charms for names, costs, theme, etc.) into 3e mechanics, with a hefty amount of homebrew added in to give it that 3e Charms chapter heft. So I'd feel uncomfortable if the owners of the original work weren't compensated.<br /> <br /> I thought the storyteller vault was the place for such works, but I was incorrect.</div> </div> </div> </div>The only reassurance I can grant you is that I sincerely doubt that anyone will be so satisfied by a fan made Jumpstart that they won\u2019t get the actual Sids book when it comes out. Not to mention, I don\u2019t think that anyone involved in making the 1E and 2E Sidereals books would be in a position to earn money off of Storyteller Vault sales.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1424-ghanjrho","name":"GhanjRho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1424_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}